    Takes inputs: {'numerator': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Value that appears on the top of the fraction.'}, 'denominator': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Value that appears on the bottom of the fraction.'}, 'decimals': {'type': 'integer', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Number of decimal places to round to (default **2**).'}}
    Returns an output of type: string
